<title>ITALY: Consob to meet Olivetti board, auditors Thursday.</title>
<headline>Consob to meet Olivetti board, auditors Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian stock market watchdog authority Consob will meet with the board and the auditors of crisis-hit information technology group Olivetti at 1300 GMT on Thursday in Rome, said a spokesman for Consob.</p>
<p>The move follows the resignation of Olivetti's director general in charge of finance, administration and auditing Renzo Francesconi last week after he cast doubt over the accuracy of the group's first-half 1996 financial accounts.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
